{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00071",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.07,
      "end_seconds": 3.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Good evening. Sorry to keep you waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.11,
      "end_seconds": 4.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hi."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.86,
      "end_seconds": 7.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.47,
      "end_seconds": 11.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Not great, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.49,
      "end_seconds": 15.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Tell me from the beginning, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.6,
      "end_seconds": 23.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "It's headaches in the mornings, mostly. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.34,
      "end_seconds": 26.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Alright, and when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.66,
      "end_seconds": 36.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.17,
      "text": "I'm not sure when it began, to be honest. Some weeks ago, but I can't say how many."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.34,
      "end_seconds": 44.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.07,
      "end_seconds": 57.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.51,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. It sort of comes and goes. And there's a little puffiness in the ankles as well, four weeks now. I've had occasional dizziness too, for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.47,
      "end_seconds": 62.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.13,
      "end_seconds": 63.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.89,
      "end_seconds": 80.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any chest pain, palpitations or vision changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.92,
      "end_seconds": 86.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain, palpitations or vision changes, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.94,
      "end_seconds": 88.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Any breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.17,
      "end_seconds": 91.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "No breathlessness, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.54,
      "end_seconds": 97.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.25,
      "end_seconds": 103.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.03,
      "end_seconds": 108.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.87,
      "end_seconds": 109.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.39,
      "end_seconds": 123.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What medicines do you take regularly? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.3,
      "end_seconds": 127.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I take atorvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.06,
      "end_seconds": 131.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.13,
      "end_seconds": 132.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.63,
      "end_seconds": 151.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.56,
      "end_seconds": 156.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I had a lump removed from my back years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.43,
      "end_seconds": 169.87,
      "duration_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.62,
      "end_seconds": 172.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.97,
      "end_seconds": 175.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.51,
      "end_seconds": 179.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.2,
      "end_seconds": 184.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Alright, is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.17,
      "end_seconds": 189.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.65,
      "end_seconds": 193.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.65,
      "end_seconds": 198.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.35,
      "end_seconds": 203.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Okay, high cholesterol, that's already on your record. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.74,
      "end_seconds": 207.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.12,
      "end_seconds": 208.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.7,
      "end_seconds": 227.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.02,
      "end_seconds": 235.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.86,
      "end_seconds": 250.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.9 degrees, pulse 81, BP is 154 over 103. And respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.1,
      "end_seconds": 253.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.68,
      "end_seconds": 256.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.35,
      "end_seconds": 259.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.09,
      "end_seconds": 260.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.28,
      "end_seconds": 268.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.35,
      "end_seconds": 275.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.38,
      "end_seconds": 278.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.33,
      "end_seconds": 288.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.19,
      "end_seconds": 291.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.63,
      "end_seconds": 294.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.41,
      "end_seconds": 307.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "There's mild pitting swelling at both ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.4,
      "end_seconds": 324.94,
      "duration_seconds": 14.54,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.72,
      "end_seconds": 337.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.36,
      "end_seconds": 343.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is hypertension that isn't well controlled."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.12,
      "end_seconds": 348.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.34,
      "end_seconds": 368.66,
      "duration_seconds": 17.32,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now hypertension that isn't well controlled is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had headaches in the mornings, mild, and no vision changes or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.04,
      "end_seconds": 372.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.95,
      "end_seconds": 375.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Alright, is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.02,
      "end_seconds": 378.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.98,
      "end_seconds": 388.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "text": "We should do an ECG for hypertension. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'd like to arrange a lipid profile for cardiovascular risk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.06,
      "end_seconds": 392.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.11,
      "end_seconds": 409.54,
      "duration_seconds": 15.43,
      "text": "Let's use telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day, long term. That's for high blood pressure. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Salt is the big one, try to keep it low even though it's hard."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 410.11,
      "end_seconds": 420.97,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "Alright. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.01,
      "end_seconds": 423.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.06,
      "end_seconds": 427.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 427.92,
      "end_seconds": 432.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.07,
      "end_seconds": 437.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.97,
      "end_seconds": 445.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "So, I take the telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day and come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.11,
      "end_seconds": 452.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 453.43,
      "end_seconds": 455.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}